## The Newton-Raphson method: numerical experiment

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="45%"}

::: {#1d9b598d .cell execution_count=19}
``` {.julia .cell-code code-line-numbers="false"}
function newton_raphson(f, df, x, maxiter; ε = 1e-12)
    for i in 1:maxiter
        x -= f(x) / df(x)
        if abs(f(x)) < ε
            return x, i
        end
    end
    return "Failed to converge!"
end;
```
